==Description==
The '''Navy Camo Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from Major I rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

The '''Navy Camo Nametag''' has text with a light grey to dark blue gradient and a black outline. Blue, grey and black camo background can be seen behind the text. An icon of the Major rank can be seen next to the text.

